eezes on his face. Lu Ming (S1) says with a tone of quiet astonishment: <d>[Chinese] 前十？</d>\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.000, the shot transitions to a medium shot of the grand entrance of Leihuo Hall, where a weathered wooden plaque reading \"雷火馆\" hangs prominently above the heavy stone gate. Lu Ming (S1) says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 青原坊四座三级神通馆之一。<scenetrans></d> His lips remain closed.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:11.000, the camera cuts to a wide shot of the training ground inside the courtyard, where several disciples in matching simple robes are practicing martial arts, thrusting their fists in unison. The off-screen voiceover of Lu Ming (S1) continues seamlessly across the cut: <d>[Chinese] <scenetrans>章岳有上品神通骨，<scenetrans></d> His lips remain closed.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:13.000, the camera cuts to a close-up of an old wooden resource cabinet, its shelves sparse and holding only a few withered medicinal herbs. The off-screen voiceover of Lu Ming (S1) continues seamlessly across the cut: <d>[Chinese] <scenetrans>是馆里最被看重的弟子。</d> His lips remain closed.\n\noverall_soundscape: The rustling of leaves in a light breeze, the soft friction of cotton and silk clothing as the characters move, the distant, rhythmic grunts of disciples practicing martial arts, and the gentle creaking of wooden doors.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A slow, traditional Chinese bamboo flute melody plays softly, accompanied by the gentle plucking of a guzheng, creating a serene yet slightly tense"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 268, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 155, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "label": "Filenames", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}, {"name": "images", "links": [], "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": {"save_output": t